{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20794","headline":"杂兴 · 卢仝","name":"杂兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"意志未成百不解，见人富贵亦心爱。\n等闲对酒呼三达，屠羊杀牛皆自在。\n放心爲乐笙歌攒，壮气激作风霜寒。\n厨中玉馔盈金盘，方丈厌见嫌不餐。\n飞鹰跃马实快性，唇腐齿烂空漓岏。\n岂期福极翻成祸，祸成身诛家亦破。\n昨朝惆怅不如君，今日悲君不如我。\n否泰交加无定主，嬾学风云戢翎羽。\n绿酒清琴好养生，出将入相无心取。\n三五图书旧揣摩，五千道德新䂓矩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}